son Wistrand).\n\n## Upcoming Events\n\n## Cows and heifers due in the next month\n\n| Cow/Heifer   | Due Date   |\n|--------------|------------|\n| Lucy         | 2/16       |\n| Diane        | 2/16       |\n| Violet       | 2/23       |\n| Julie        | 2/23       |\n| Melody       | 3/01       |\n| Jessica      | 3/01       |\n| Katrina      | 3/26       |\n| Cookie       | 4/02       |\n| Swash        | 4/06       |",
